# .env.example  [Secret names, no secret values]
# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Purpose   Tell teammates WHICH secrets and environment switches exist, without sharing values
# How       Copy to .env and fill in real values. .env is in .gitignore AND .dockerignore
# Read by   main.py and api.py at startup
# Cloud     The same names are set as GitHub Secrets (CI/CD) and host environment variables
#
# Typical entries
#   experiment tracking API key and account name
#   tracking mode (online, offline, disabled)
#   model source for the API (local file or model registry) and registry alias (e.g. prod)
